{title: By The Touch Of Your Hand}
{artist: Larry Holder}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 80}

Verse 1
We are vessels in the potter's hand
Waiting for Your gentle touch
Skillfully embraced and molded in life
All by the touch of Your hand

Chorus
We can become what
You wants us to be
Useful vessels for a hurting world
So mold us and make us, Master Creator
All by the touch of Your hand
All by the touch of Your hand

Verse 2
Some vessels are broken with time
But You never give up on us
You repair our lives, then we may go on
All by the touch of Your hand

Bridge
Sealed with Your fire
May we carry Your name
Chosen vessels of honor and mercy
